  "lore.block.aether_genesis.blood_moss_holystone": "An unbreakable stone found at the edges of labyrinths, covered in an off putting red moss.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.blue_skyroot_leaves": "These leaves generate with Blue Skyroot Trees. They can drop Blue Skyroot Saplings and Skyroot Sticks when decaying.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.blue_skyroot_sapling": "These small blue saplings will grow into Skyroot Trees. They can be grown faster with Bone Meal.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.carved_pillar": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.carved_pillar_top": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.continuum_ore": "A rare ore found in the Aether. It will drop a Continuum Orb when mined with a Gravitite Pickaxe.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.dark_blue_skyroot_leaves": "These leaves generate with Dark Blue Skyroot Trees. They can drop Dark Blue Skyroot Saplings and Skyroot Sticks when decaying.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.dark_blue_skyroot_sapling": "These dark blue saplings will grow into a towering type of Skyroot Tree. They can be grown faster with Bone Meal.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.divine_carved_slab": "Crafted from Divine Carved Stone. Slabs are half blocks, versatile for decoration and smooth slopes. Try adding some to a building's roofing!",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.divine_carved_stairs": "Crafted from Divine Carved Stone. Stairs are useful for adding verticality to builds and are often used for decoration too!",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.divine_carved_stone": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.divine_carved_wall": "Crafted from Mossy Divine Carved Stone. Can be used for decorative enclosures and defenses. Great for keeping nasty intruders away!",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.divine_sentry_stone": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.enchanted_grass_block": "A Grass Block that has been enchanted to allow for increasing harvest rates of Blue Berries.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.green_aercloud": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.holystone_furnace": "A furnace constructed from Holystone. This can be used to cook both ores and food while surviving in the Aether.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.holystone_headstone": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.holystone_highlight": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.holystone_keystone": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.orange_tree": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.purple_aercloud": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.purple_crystal_fruit_leaves": "Leaves that come from Purple Crystal Trees, found amongst wooded areas. Sometimes they have fruit on them that can cure Inebriation.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.purple_crystal_leaves": "Purple Crystal Leaves that are home to White Apples.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.purple_crystal_tree_sapling": "These spindly saplings will grow into tall Crystal Trees with purple leaves. They can be grown faster with Bone Meal.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.skyroot_chest": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.skyroot_chest_mimic": "It may look like a normal Skyroot Chest, but it really isn't. As soon as you right-click on it, a Chest Mimic will pop out! These appear in Bronze and Silver Dungeons.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.skyroot_crafting_table": "A workbench made of Skyroot, capable of crafting anything you might need.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.skyroot_ladder": "",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.skyroot_log_wall": "Crafted from Skyroot Logs. Can be used for decorative enclosures and defenses. Great for keeping nasty intruders away!",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.skyroot_wood_wall": "Crafted from Skyroot Wood. Can be used for decorative enclosures and defenses. Great for keeping nasty intruders away!",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.storm_aercloud": "A dark, dim cloud found low in the Aether. Some say this is where Tempests originate from at nightfall.",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.stripped_skyroot_log_wall": "Crafted from Stripped Skyroot Logs. Can be used for decorative enclosures and defenses. Great for keeping nasty intruders away!",
  "lore.block.aether_genesis.stripped_skyroot_wood_wall": "Crafted from Stripped Skyroot Wood. Can be used for decorative enclosures and defenses. Great for keeping nasty intruders away!",
